OL,5,G0600 James Martin's American Adventure
OL,6,     FJames begins the Texan leg of his
OL,7,     FAmerican adventure by visiting San
OL,8,     FAntonio - a place with more than a
OL,9,     Fhint of Mexican spice as it was
OL,10,     Fonce a part of Mexico - and trying
OL,11,     Ffresh chorros and a traditional
OL,12,     FMexican barbeque that is known as
OL,13,     Fa barbecoa.
